          "key": "line:MushroomEater_Entrance_2_3_010fac7",
          "source": "MushroomEater: И помни: грибы – не то, чем кажутся.",
          "target": "MushroomEater: और याद रखो: मशरूम जैसे दिखते हैं, वैसे हैं नहीं।",
          "sourceSha256": "88cf7762ad6391d9f968c5c4cf20e1880d971242437bd98c8ce0df5137d23761",
          "targetSha256": "d72da8871cc6d6589b3aca3da9ae64808355b027c791f3c36be7c4649f6eac2d",
